# Force LF line endings regardless of platform. dashboard.json's exact bytes
# are embedded into a Kubernetes ConfigMap by monitoring.ts - if Windows and
# Linux checkouts disagree on line endings, `pulumi preview` reports spurious
# drift on every run on a CRLF-checkout machine. Keep everything text-based
# reproducible across OSes (local machines and CI agents alike).
* text=auto eol=lf
